WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Isaac Sim kinematic concept. Diamond, Gyroid, and Primitive slot-tenon pairs are labeled from left to right.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The darker tenon variants move toward the stationary partners in a staggered sequence. Family names distinguish the shapes independently of color.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The three pairs hold nominal neighboring positions. This is a shadow-free CAD geometry comparison, not proof of physical assembly.
